ting our sixth and ultimate game night of the semester. Join the team for a relaxing walk through the Brushy Fork Forest, where we will discuss the different meanings of \"habitat\", and celebrate the types of habitat that we all share.',NULL,5,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(216,'AGP Volunteer Training',9,'16:30:00','17:30:00','Arts and Crafts Room, Stephenson Hall',1,0,0,0,'2022-09-22','agp@berea.edu','Aimee Ninahaza',0,'Come learn what AGP is all about and how you can volunteer!',NULL,1,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(226,'Weekly ELL Tutoring Week 1',9,'18:00:00','19:00:00','Madison County Public Library ',0,0,1,0,'2023-02-01','hop@berea.edu','Sabdi Lopez Jimenez',0,'Weekly English Language Learner Tutoring',NULL,6,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(227,'Weekly ELL Tutoring Week 2',9,'18:00:00','19:00:00','Madison County Public Library ',0,0,1,0,'2023-02-08','hop@berea.edu','Sabdi Lopez Jimenez',0,'Weekly English Language Learner Tutoring',NULL,6,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(228,'Weekly ELL Tutoring Week 3',9,'18:00:00','19:00:00','Madison County Public Library ',0,0,1,0,'2023-02-15','hop@berea.edu','Sabdi Lopez Jimenez',0,'Weekly English Language Learner Tutoring',NULL,6,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(229,'Weekly ELL Tutoring Week 4',9,'18:00:00','19:00:00','Madison County Public Library ',0,0,1,0,'2023-02-22','hop@berea.edu','Sabdi Lopez Jimenez',0,'Weekly English Language Learner Tutoring',NULL,6,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(230,'Weekly ELL Tutoring Week 5',9,'18:00:00','19:00:00','Madison County Public Library ',0,0,1,0,'2023-03-01','hop@berea.edu','Sabdi Lopez Jimenez',0,'Weekly English Language Learner Tutoring',NULL,6,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(231,'Weekly ELL Tutoring Week 6',9,'18:00:00','19:00:00','Madison County Public Library ',0,0,1,0,'2023-03-08','hop@berea.edu','Sabdi Lopez Jimenez',0,'Weekly English Language Learner Tutoring',NULL,6,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(232,'Weekly ELL Tutoring Week 7',9,'18:00:00','19:00:00','Madison County Public Library ',0,0,1,0,'2023-03-15','hop@berea.edu','Sab