ial speaker who recently graduated from Berea College and currently works with La Casita in Louisville.',NULL,7,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(474,'Deck Staining in Richmond',11,'09:30:00','15:30:00','Richmond, KY',0,1,1,0,'2023-10-14','habitat@berea.edu','Maria Elkins',1,'Come volunteer with Habitat and stain the deck of a Habitat home-owner! Lunch and transportation are provided. ',4,5,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(475,'Habitat Connect #3',11,'18:00:00','19:00:00','Activities Room (214)',0,1,1,0,'2023-10-25','habitat@berea.edu','Maria Elkins',1,'Come join the Habitat team for an hour, have some light snacks, and appreciate the service that you do for our communities!',NULL,5,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(476,'Bonner Orientation',11,'08:30:00','18:00:00','Corbin, KY',1,1,0,0,'2023-10-14','celts@berea.edu','Sarah Rohrer',1,'First Year Bonner Orientation at Sheltowee Trace Resort.',NULL,10,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(478,'All Bonner Meeting Fall 2023',11,'17:00:00','19:00:00','Stephenson 2nd Floor Activities Room',0,0,1,0,'2023-10-15','ackermanc@berea.edu','Chase Ackerman',1,'Required event for all Bonner Scholars for the fall of 2023. This meeting will be giving out information for the next school year, everyone must be in attendance by 5:15 PM.',NULL,10,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(479,'After the Flood: Labor Meeting Film Showcase',11,'16:00:00','17:30:00','Phelps Stokes',0,0,0,0,'2023-10-17','celts@berea.edu','CELTS Admin',0,'In collaboration with Kentuckians for the Common Wealth, CELTS will be showcasing the film After the Flood by Ali Gautier. The film will be talking about the Black, Appalachian, Kentuckian experience specifically with the devastating floods occurring summer of last year.',NULL,9,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(480,'Habitat Office Volunteering',11,'14:00:00','16:00:00','Habitat Office (Richmond)',0,1,1,0,'2023-10-27','habitat@berea.edu','Maria Elkins',1,'Come help out at the Habitat office with cleaning, organizing, and more in support of our wonderful community partner!',