eshing desserts, and collect free merch!',NULL,9,0,'heggensa','2024-09-08 18:11:58',0,0,NULL,0),(702,'REQUIRED AGP Specific Training ',18,'17:00:00','18:00:00','2nd floor of Stephenson building in room 208 (Arts and Crafts room)',1,0,0,0,'2024-09-19','agp@berea.edu','Andrea Patton',0,'Join us for our program specific training from 5-6 pm. We will be located on the 2nd floor of Stephenson building in room 208 (Arts and Crafts room). This training is REQUIRED for ALL students who intend to volunteer with AGP this semester, regardless of whether you are a new or returning volunteer. We can\'t wait to see you there!',NULL,1,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(703,'All Volunteer Training',18,'05:15:00','06:30:00','Stephenson',1,0,0,0,'2024-08-28','celts@berea.edu','CELTS Admin',0,'Training for all volunteers',NULL,9,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(704,'All Volunteer Training',18,'05:15:00','06:30:00','Stephenson',1,0,0,0,'2024-09-03','celts@berea.edu','CELTS Admin',0,'Training for all volunteers',NULL,9,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(705,'HOP ELL (English Language Learner) Tutor Training',18,'09:00:00','15:00:00','Stephenson Hall 208 (CELTS Arts and Crafts Room)',1,1,0,0,'2024-09-14','hop@berea.edu','Rilie Ledford/Ashley Cochrane',1,'Participants in this training will develop their knowledge and skills related to supporting others in developing English Language Skills. While HOP isn\'t currently recruiting volunteers, we are pleased to offer this training in collaboration with Madison County Adult Education Program as a professional development opportunity. Participants must commit to attending the full training (9 a.m. to 3 p.m.). Participants should bring a laptop or phone to access resources during the training. Certificate of completion will be provided to participants. Lunch at Dining Services provided by CELTS, as well as snacks throughout the day. Summary of Event: Participant has successfully completed the 5-hour English Language Learning (ELL) Tutor Training provided by the Hispanic Outreach Program in collaboration with the Madison County Adult Education Program. Attendees of this training enhanced their expertise and proficiency in assisting others with the development of language skills.\r\n',NULL,6,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(706,'All Volunteer Training',18,'18:00:00','19:15:00','Stephenson Hall 208 (CELTS Arts and Crafts Room)',1,0,0,0,'2024-09-05','celts@berea.edu','CELTS Admin',0,'Training for all CELTS volunteers',NULL,9,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(707,'All Bonner Meeting',18,'16:00:00','18:00:00','Stephenson',0,0,0,0,'2024-09-08','celts@berea.edu','Sarah Rohrer',1,'Fall 2024 All Bonner Meeting',NULL,10,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(708,'Bonner Orientation ',18,'16:30:00','23:00:00','Sheltowee Trace Adventure Resort',0,0,0,0,'2024-09-08','celts@berea.edu','Sarah Rohrer',0,'Welcome to the Bonner program! First Years get together to celebrate their decision to join and to get to know their cohort. ',NULL,10,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(709,'Richmond Porch Sanding ',18,'09:00:00','13:00:00','Richmond, KY',0,1,1,0,'2024-09-12','habitat@berea.edu','Summer Bahr',0,'Come along with us to Richmond, KY, as we sand down the remaining paint of a porch and ramp of two Habitat homes. We will meet behind Woods-Penn and leave promptly at 9:00 am, and we will leave the work site at 12:30 pm to ensure we return to Berea by 1:00 pm. ',5,5,0,'ledfordr','2024-09-09 17:52:21',0,0,NULL,0),(710,'PWC-Specific Training',18,'09:00:00','15:30:00','Stephenson Hall, 2nd Floor',1,1,0,0,'2024-09-06','pwc@berea.edu','Maria Elkins (Fall 24)',0,'Come get trained to participate in service trips with People Who Care!',NULL,7,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(711,'PWC-Specific Training',18,'08:00:00','12:00:00','Stephenson Hall, 2nd Floor',1,1,0,0,'2024-09-20','pwc@berea.edu','Maria Elkins (Fall 24)',0,'Come get trained to participate in service trips with People Who Care!',NULL,7,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(712,'BTM Specific Training!',18,'17:00:00','18:00:00','Stephenson, Second Floor, Activities Room',1,0,0,0,'2024-09-12','bereateenmentoring@berea.edu','Kori Kobylak',0,'Berea Teen Mentoring Program-Specific Training. If you are interested in volunteering with Berea Teen Mentoring this is an essential program to attend.',NULL,3,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(713,'Chill with PWC!',18,'17:00:00','18:30:00','Stephenson Hall, Arts and Crafts Room (2nd Floor)',0,1,1,0,'2024-09-12','pwc@berea.edu','Maria Elkins (Fall24)',1,'An opportunity to get to know the team and each other, enjoy some snacks, and create a volunteer passport to track your service!',NULL,7,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(714,'Berea Teen Mentoring Weekly Programming - Fall 24! Week 1',18,'16:45:00','20:00:00','Stephenson, Second Floor, Activities Room',0,0,1,0,'2024-09-26','bereateenmentoring@berea.edu','Kori Kobylak',0,'BTM Weekly Program! A time for teens to come to the CELTS and Berea College and learn about how the college works and grow as people! ',NULL,3,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(715,'Berea Teen Mentoring Weekly Programming - Fall 24! Week 2',18,'17:00:00','20:00:00','Stephenson, Second Floor, Activities Room',0,0,1,0,'2024-10-03','bereateenmentoring@berea.edu','Kori Kobylak',0,'BTM Weekly Program! A time for teens to come to the CELTS and Berea College and learn about how the college works and grow as people! ',NULL,3,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(716,'Berea Teen Mentoring Weekly Programming - Fall 24! Week 3',18,'17:00:00','20:00:00','Stephenson, Second Floor, Activities Room',0,0,1,0,'2024-10-10','bereateenmentoring@berea.edu','Kori Kobylak',0,'BTM Weekly Program! A time for teens to come to the CELTS and Berea College and learn about how the college works and grow as people! ',NULL,3,0,'kobylakp','2024-09-10 15:39:55',0,0,NULL,0),(717,'Berea Teen Mentoring Weekly Programming - Fall 24! Week 3',18,'17:00:00','20:00:00','Stephenson, Second Floor, Activities Room',0,0,1,0,'2024-10-17','bereateenmentoring@berea.edu','Kori Kobylak',0,'BTM Weekly Program! A time for teens to come to the CELTS and Berea College a