gton, KY. Once our team arrives, we will attend the opening ceremony from roughly 2:30 pm until the event formally begins at 3:00 pm. At that point, we will contribute by cheering for participants at both the start and finish lines for the duration of the walk. We expect to depart from the event around 4:00 pm and arrive back on campus by 5:00 pm. ',NULL,1,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(765,'Monday Tutoring Sessions Week 1',18,'16:00:00','19:00:00','Stephenson Hall, 2nd floor, room 212',0,0,1,0,'2024-09-23','bereatutoring@berea.edu','Eric Sparks',0,'Normal Programming hours for Berea Tutoring, tutoring between program participants and volunteers will be facilitated during this time.',NULL,4,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(766,'Monday Tutoring Sessions Week 2',18,'16:00:00','19:00:00','Stephenson Hall, 2nd floor, room 212',0,0,1,0,'2024-09-30','bereatutoring@berea.edu','Eric Sparks',0,'Normal Programming hours for Berea Tutoring, tutoring between program participants and volunteers will be facilitated during this time.',NULL,4,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(767,'Monday Tutoring Sessions Week 3',18,'16:00:00','19:00:00','Stephenson Hall, 2nd floor, room 212',0,0,1,0,'2024-10-07','bereatutoring@berea.edu','Eric Sparks',0,'Normal Programming hours for Berea Tutoring, tutoring between program participants and volunteers will be facilitated during this time.',NULL,4,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(768,'Monday Tutoring Sessions Week 4',18,'16:00:00','19:00:00','Stephenson Hall, 2nd floor, room 212',0,0,1,0,'2024-10-14','bereatutoring@berea.edu','Eric Sparks',0,'Normal Programming hours for Berea Tutoring, tutoring between program participants and volunteers will be facilitated during this time.',NULL,4,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(769,'Monday Tutoring Sessions Week 5',18,'16:00:00','19:00:00','Stephenson Hall, 2nd floor, room 212',0,0,1,0,'2024-10-21','bereatutoring@berea.edu','Eric Sparks',0,'Normal Programming hours for Berea Tutoring, tutoring between program participants and volunteers will be faci