hange, and the development of collaborative solutions to combat food insecurity. Through the convergence of students, non-profit organizations, educators, and engaged community members, the event promotes the fusion of diverse perspectives and expertise, aiming to alleviate food insecurity on our campuses and in our communities. \r\nCELTS will take a team of students to participate in this day-long conference at nearby EKU (in Richmond, KY). To participate, students must be able to miss class and labor on Friday, Nov. 8 from 8 a.m. to 5 p.m. Breakfast and lunch are provided at the conference. This is a professional development event; students will not receive labor or service hours for attending. https://kyhungerdialogue.org/\r\nRegister with CELTS to attend no later than Thursday, Oct. 31 at 5 p.m. (deadline extended).',24,9,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(799,'Berea Buddies Monday Programming Week 1',18,'17:15:00','20:00:00','Meet at Woods-Penn. Program at Stephenson Hall',0,0,1,0,'2024-09-23','bereabuddies@berea.edu','Ashley Sanchez',0,'Berea Buddies mentorship program',NULL,2,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(800,'Richmond Porch Staining',18,'09:00:00','16:00:00','Richmond, KY',0,1,1,0,'2024-09-28','habitat@berea.edu','Summer Bahr',1,'Sign up to assist with a porch staining project hosted by the Madison and Clark County Affiliate in Richmond! We\'ll be staining a new front porch and back deck and are looking for 6 volunteers to help us out. \r\n\r\nDate = 9/28/2024\r\nTime = 9:00 am - 4:00 pm \r\n \r\nWe will be closing the registration on Wednesday at noon, and from there, we\'ll email those who made the cutoff. We can\'t wait to work with you!\r\n',6,5,0,'bahrs','2024-12-06 16:51:36',0,0,NULL,0),(801,'Berea Buddies Tuesday Programming Week 1',18,'17:15:00','20:00:00','Meet at Woods-Penn. Program at Stephenson Hall',0,0,1,0,'2024-09-23','bereabuddies@berea.edu','Ashley Sanchez',0,'Berea Buddies Mentoring Program',NULL,2,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(802,'2024 Berea Pride Royalty Pageant',18,'17:00:00','20:00:00','Boone Tavern Hotel (100 S. Main St, Berea, KY 40403)',0,1,1,0,'2024-09-28','pwc@berea.edu','Maria Elkins (Fall24)',0,'Come join the PWC team in helping out with set-up, decorations, and anything else needed in support of the pageant! \r\n\r\n',3,7,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(803,'SPN 310 Alebrijes Ballet ',18,'13:00:00','18:00:00','Mitchell Fine Arts Center, Transylvania University',1,1,0,0,'2024-09-28','hop@berea.edu','Rilie Ledford/Ashley Cochrane',0,'Students in the Fall 2024 SPN 310 course are invited to attend a performance of Alebrijes, an original ballet by Bluegrass Youth Ballet, which tells the origin story of this colorful and beautiful form of Mexican folk art. BYB is a non-profit organization that strives to make the classic art form of ballet accessible to young people in central Kentucky. This is one of two original ballets performed regularly by BYB that celebrate elements of Mexican cultural traditions. ',NULL,6,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(804,'Berea Buddies Monday Programming Week 2',18,'17:15:00','20:00:00','Meet at Woods-Penn. Program at Stephenson Hall',0,0,1,0,'2024-09-30','bereabuddies@berea.edu','Ashley Sanchez',0,'Berea Buddies will be having their Monday programming tonight.',NULL,2,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(805,'Berea Buddies Tuesday Programming Week 2',18,'17:15:00','20:00:00','Meet at Woods-Penn. Program at Stephenson Hall',0,0,1,0,'2024-10-01','bereabuddies@berea.edu','Ashley Sanchez',0,'Berea Buddies will be having their Tuesday programming tonight.',NULL,2,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(806,'Test',18,'12:00:00','13:00:00','Berea',1,0,0,0,'2024-10-04','hop@berea.edu','Rilie Ledford/Ashley Cochrane',0,' ',NULL,6,0,'cruzduenask','2024-10-04 14:17:33',0,0,NULL,0),(807,'Richmond Porch Staining Rescheduled',18,'09:00:00','14:30:00','Richmond, KY',0,1,1,0,'2024-10-15','habitat@berea.edu','Summer Bahr',1,'Please join us as we go to Richmond to assist the Madison and Clark County Affiliate with a deck and porch staining project! We will meet behind Woods-Penn at 9:00 am and will return to campus no later than 4 pm. Lunch will be provided by dining services. ',3,5,0,'bahrs','2024-12-06 16:12:43',0,0,NULL,0),(808,'Fun Friday 2',18,'15:00:00','17:00:00','Stephenson Hall, 2nd floor, room 212',1,0,0,0,'2024-11-15','bereatutoring@berea.edu','Eric Sparks',0,'A day of fun activities where the Tutoring team hosts an event/activity with food provided. Only tutors and tutees are allowed to attend.',NULL,4,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(809,'Fun Friday 1',18,'15:00:00','17:00:00','Stephenson Hall, 2nd floor, room 212',1,0,0,0,'2024-10-25','bereatutoring@berea.edu','Eric Sparks',0,'A day of fun activities where the Tutoring team hosts an event/activity with food provided. Only tutors and tutees are allowed to attend.',NULL,4,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(810,'Cafe SJ: Queer History with Gen Action',18,'18:00:00','19:30:00','Stephenson Hall',0,1,1,0,'2024-10-09','pwc@berea.edu','Maria Elkins (Fall24)',1,'PWC collaborates with GenAction to talk about queer history and the resources that GenAction offers to students, and we will be doing a small craft!\r\n\r\nSnacks and light refreshments provided.',NULL,7,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(811,'Chill with PWC: Zine Making',18,'17:00:00','18:30:00','Stephenson Hall, Arts and Crafts Room (2nd Floor)',0,1,1,0,'2024-10-17','pwc@berea.edu','Maria Elkins (Fall24)',1,'Come chill with PWC, learn about queer history, and create zines! ',NULL,7,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(812,'Berea PRIDE Service Trip!',18,'13:00:00','16:30:00','Berea Friends Meeting Place, 300 Harrison Rd, Berea, KY',0,1,1,0,'2024-10-13','pwc@berea.edu','Maria Elkins (Fall24)',1,'Join PWC in helping the 11th House Foundation celebrate Berea PRIDE!',5,7,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(813,'Berea PRIDE Service Trip!',18,'17:00:00','20:30:00','Berea Friends Meeting Place, 300 Harrison Rd, Berea, KY',0,1,1,0,'2024-10-13','pwc@berea.edu','Maria Elkins (Fall24)',1,'Join PWC in helping the 11th House Foundation celebrate Berea PR