aningful conversation and moments of gratitude, and serve a variety of light refreshments between our groups to build community and honor our diverse cultures/backgrounds. We\'d be thrilled for you all to join us for an afternoon of fun and connection! \r\n\r\nOur van will depart from Alumni Circle by 1:00 pm and should return to campus by 5:00 pm.  ',NULL,1,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(827,'Rescheduled Habitat Office Organization',18,'09:00:00','15:00:00','Richmond, KY',0,1,1,0,'2024-10-29','habitat@berea.edu','Summer Bahr',1,'Please join us as we assist the Richmond Affiliate at their headquarters by painting trim and reorganizing tools and materials! This event was initially planned for this past Sunday, October 27, but due to unforeseen circumstances, we\'re squeezing it in now! We hope you can join :)',3,5,0,'bahrs','2024-12-06 16:56:33',0,0,NULL,0),(828,'Kentucky Exchange (Sophomore Exchange)',18,'09:00:00','16:00:00','Woods-Penn Commons ',0,0,0,0,'2024-10-26','casanovamaldonadom@berea.edu','Melany Casanova-Maldonado',0,'We’re so excited to be hosting Bonners from Bellarmine, Centre, and Lindsey Wilson Colleges in Berea for this event. This Bonner Scholars requirement is also required \r\n for juniors this year, to satisfy their sophomore requirement.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nSaturday, Oct. 26, 2024 – Kentucky Bonner Exchange\r\n\r\n9 – 9:30 a.m.                      Arrive, breakfast snacks, settle in\r\n\r\n9:30 – 10:30 a.m.             Welcome, Opening activities\r\n\r\n10:30 a.m. – 12:30 p.m. Workshop: “Resilience-Building” led by Taryn Henning\r\n\r\n12:30 – 1:30 p.m.             Lunch and Service Project Orientations\r\n\r\n1:30 – 3:30 p.m.                Service Projects: “Getting to Know Berea”\r\n\r\n3:30 – 4 p.m.                      Reflection, wrap up\r\n\r\n4 p.m.                                   Departure',NULL,10,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(829,'Service Trip with GreenHouse17!',18,'11:00:00','14:00:00','Lexington, KY',0,1,1,0,'2024-11-08','pwc@berea.edu','Maria Elkins (Fall24)',1,'Come join PWC in volunteering with our previous Café SJ guest, GreenHouse17 at their site location in Lexington, KY!\r\n\r\nGreenHouse17 is an advocacy agency that is committed to ending intimate partner abuse in families and the community, and provides shelter for these individuals.\r\n\r\nTransportation and snacks provided.',5,7,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(830,'Lexington Affiliate Build',18,'08:00:00','17:00:00','Lexington, KY',0,1,1,0,'2024-11-02','habitat@berea.edu','Summer Bahr',1,'Come join us for our first Lexington build of the semester! We will be assisting the affiliate with finishing up building the frame and walls of a new Habitat home. We\'d love to see you there :)',4,5,0,'bahrs','2024-11-11 15:50:03',0,0,NULL,0),(831,'Richmond Porch Powerwashing',18,'09:00:00','15:30:00','Richmond, KY',0,0,1,0,'2024-09-07','habitat@berea.edu','Summer Bahr',0,'We will be power washing and stripping paint from two porches and patios in Richmond to help start the next phase of a staining project! ',NULL,5,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(832,'Habitat-Specific Training 1',18,'17:00:00','18:00:00','Stephenson Activities Room',1,0,0,0,'2024-09-06','habitat@berea.edu','Summer Bahr',0,'Please join us in the Stephenson Activities Room as we go through the important details pertaining to Habitat volunteer work and what you can expect in the year ahead as a Habitat volunteer! ',NULL,5,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(833,'Habitat-Specific Training 2',18,'17:00:00','18:00:00','Stephenson Activities Room',1,0,0,0,'2024-09-09','habitat@berea.edu','Summer Bahr',0,'Please join us in the Stephenson Activities Room as we go through the important details pertaining to Habitat volunteer work and what you can expect in the year ahead as a Habitat volunteer! ',NULL,5,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(834,'Richmond Porch Sanding',18,'09:00:00','13:00:00','Richmond, KY',0,0,1,0,'2024-09-12','habitat@berea.edu','Summer Bahr',0,'Assisting the Madison and Clark County Affiliate by sanding and smoothing a wheelchair ramp so it can be restained!',NULL,5,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(835,'AGP x Irvine Christmas Collaboration',18,'14:30:00','17:30:00','Irvine Nursing and Rehabilitation in Irvine, KY',0,1,1,0,'2024-12-07','agp@berea.edu','Andrea Patton',1,'The AGP team would like to invite you all to join us for a Christmas Celebration at Irvine Nursing and Rehabilitation in Irvine, KY, where we\'ll be painting salt dough ornaments, enjoying a variety of light refreshments, and taking photos with festive photo props! ❄️\r\n\r\nThis event will serve as the final volunteer opportunity our team offers this semester, so don\'t miss out! \r\n\r\nOur van will depart from Alumni Circle at 2:30 PM and will return to campus by 5:30 PM.',NULL,1,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(836,'Habitat Community Breakfast Event',18,'07:45:00','12:30:00','Richmond, KY',0,1,1,0,'2024-12-06','habitat@berea.edu','Summer Bahr',1,'Please join us on our last trip of the semester as we head to Richmond to assist the Madison and Clark County Affiliate with their Community Breakfast event! We\'ll be assisting them with their check-in process and ensuring all patrons receive a great breakfast. ',2,5,0,'bahrs','2024-12-06 16:35:59',0,0,NULL,0),(837,'Chill with PWC!',18,'17:00:00','18:30:00','Stephenson Hall, Connector',0,0,0,0,'2024-11-14','pwc@berea.edu','Maria Elkins (Fall24)',1,'Join PWC in creating Cards of Encouragement, chatting with one another, and enjoying light refreshments!',NULL,7,0,NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,0),(838,'Better Together 5k',18,'05:30:00','12:00:00','Berea City Park/Stephenson',0,0,0,0,'2024-11-16','heggensa@berea.edu','Sarah Heggen',0,'All CELTS students are required to contribute to this, the first of our two major fundraisers each year. ',NULL,9,0,NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,0),(839,'Junior Recommitment',18,'18:00:00','20:00:00','Galaxy Bowling',0,1,0,0,'2024-11-24','heggensa@berea.edu','Sarah Heggen',0,'This required event for Bonner Juniors is tentatively scheduled for Sunday, November 24th, 2024. We will be leaving the Stephenson Building at 5:30 PM, traveling in three CELTS vans to Galaxy Bowling in Richmond, and staying until 8 PM.',NULL,10,1,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(840,'Cafe SJ: AVOL Kentucky, Inc.',18,'17:00:00','18:30:00','Stephenson Hall, Room 226',0,1,1,0,'2024-11-20','pwc@berea.edu','Maria Elkins (Fall24)',1,'Local non-profit AVOL (AIDS Volunteers of Lexington) Kentucky, Inc. will be coming out to share about the work that they do for those living with AIDS and why this work is important. They will be providing free condoms courtesy of their program. ',NULL,7,0,'elkinsm','2024-11-21 10:21:26',0,0,NULL,0),(841,'Monday Tutoring Sessions Week 9',18,'16:00:00','19:00:00','Stephenson Hall, 2nd floor, room 212',0,0,1,0,'2024-11-18','bereatutoring@berea.edu','Eric Sparks',0,'tutoring',NULL,4,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(842,'Wednesday Tutoring Sessions Week 9',18,'16:00:00','19:00:00','Stephenson Hall, 2nd floor, room 212',0,0,1,0,'2024-11-20','bereatutoring@berea.edu','Eric Sparks',0,'tutoring',NULL,4,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(843,'Thursday Tutoring Sessions Week 9',18,'17:00:00','19:00:00','Stephenson Hall, 2nd floor, room 212',0,0,1,0,'2024-11-21','bereatutoring@berea.edu','Eric Sparks',0,'tutoring',NULL,4,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(844,'Tuesday Tutoring Sessions Week 9',18,'17:00:00','19:00:00','Stephenson Hall, 2nd floor, room 212',0,0,1,0,'2024-12-03','bereatutoring@berea.edu','Eric Sparks',0,'tutoring',NULL,4,0,'baileyr2','2024-12-03 17:38:13',0,0,NULL,0),(845,'Tuesday Tutoring Sessions Week 9',18,'17:00:00','19:00:00','Stephenson Hall, 2nd floor, room 212',0,0,1,0,'2024-11-19','bereatutoring@berea.edu','Eric Sparks',0,'tutoring',NULL,4,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(846,'Richmond Porch Staining Rescheduled',18,'09:00:00','14:30:00','Richmond, KY',0,0,1,0,'2024-10-12','habitat@berea.edu','Summer Bahr',1,'Please join us as we go to Richmond to assist the Madison and Clark County Affiliate with a deck and porch staining project! We will meet behind Woods-Penn at 9:00 