Mentoring this is an essential program to attend.',NULL,3,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(877,'AGP-Specific Training',19,'17:00:00','18:00:00','Stephenson Room 226',1,0,0,0,'2025-01-23','agp@berea.edu','Angel Alexander',0,'Join us for our program-specific training from 5-6 pm. We will be located on the 2nd floor of the Stephenson building in room 226. This training is REQUIRED for ALL students who intend to volunteer with AGP this semester, regardless of whether you are a new or returning volunteer. We can\'t wait to see you there!',NULL,1,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(878,'Tutoring-Specific Training 1 (Drop in at Any Time Listed)',19,'17:00:00','19:00:00','Stephenson Room 212',1,0,0,0,'2025-01-21','bereatutoring@berea.edu','Eric Sparks',0,'Training for Berea Tutoring',NULL,4,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(879,'Tutoring-Specific Training 2 (Drop in at Any Time Listed)',19,'17:00:00','19:00:00','Stephenson Room 212',1,0,0,0,'2025-01-23','bereatutoring@berea.edu','Eric Sparks',0,'Training for Berea Tutoring',NULL,4,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(880,'Chill with PWC: Greenhouse 17',19,'18:00:00','20:00:00','Stephenson Hall, Room 208, Arts and Crafts Room',0,0,1,0,'2025-01-28','pwc@berea.edu','Rhea Clayton',1,'People Who Care, CELTS is partnering with Greenhouse 17 to bring awareness and support to survivors of domestic violence. Join us to make cards of encouragement for the residents at Greenhouse 17 and learn more about how you can be a part of this change-making organization!\r\n\r\nThis is a service hours opportunity. Additionally, we will have a nacho bar! ',NULL,7,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(881,'Shop and Share 25',19,'08:30:00','17:00:00','Nicholasville, KY',0,1,1,0,'2025-02-08','pwc@berea.edu','Rhea Clayton',1,'Shop and Share is a yearly fundraiser for Greenhouse 17, a domestic violence shelter. Teams work in Kroger\'s to hand out \'wishlists\' to shoppers, and collect the donations from shoppers in carts after they check out. \r\n\r\n ',NULL,7,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(882,'Berea Buddies Program Specific Training',19,'18:00:00','19:00:00','Stephenson Hall',1,0,0,0,'2025-01-21','bereabuddies@berea.edu','Ashley Sanchez',0,'Training for Berea Buddies for the Spring 2025 Semester.',NULL,2,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(883,'Berea Buddies Program Specific Training',19,'18:00:00','19:00:00','Stephenson Hall',1,0,0,0,'2025-01-22','bereabuddies@berea.edu','Ashley Sanchez',0,'Training for Berea Buddies for the Spring 2025 Semester.',NULL,2,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(884,'Habitat Connect - Painting for the Affiliate',19,'17:30:00','18:30:00','Stephenson Arts and Crafts Room ',0,1,1,0,'2025-02-06','habitat@berea.edu','Summer Bahr',1,'Please join us as we create paintings for the Madison and Clark County\'s Americorps lodging at their Richmond headquarters! We hope to create special works of art to spruce up the rooms so future volunteer groups can enjoy a warm and cozy atmosphere. We\'ll be painting on canvases with acrylic paint, and all materials--including snacks--will be provided!',NULL,5,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(885,'Habitat Connect - Subsidized Housing Presentation',19,'17:30:00','18:30:00','Stephenson Activities Room',0,1,1,0,'2025-02-27','habitat@berea.edu','Summer Bahr',1,'Come join us for an evening of learning! Learn about subsidized housing from our team member Joyce, and stay afterward for a fun activity (TBD). Refreshments will be served too! ',NULL,5,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(886,'Valentines Day Special Event',19,'13:00:00','17:00:00','Legacy Reserve',0,1,1,0,'2025-02-08','agp@berea.edu','Angel Alexander',0,'The AGP team is absolutely delighted to invite you to our first special event of this semester — a Valentine’s Party! ✨\r\nJoin us for a heartwarming evening filled with love! We’ll be spreading the Valentine’s spirit with delicious treats and a special flower bouquet-making activity for our participants. ',NULL,1,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(887,'AGP Programming Week 1',19,'09:30:00','11:30:00','Dominion Senior Living',0,0,1,0,'2025-01-30','agp@berea.e