cting with fellow volunteers and community members. \r\n\r\nAt Volunteer Appreciation you can expect: \r\n\r\nA free meal from Bert’s Speak Cheesy (because you deserve the best!)\r\n\r\nA special appreciation gift from CELTS and the programs you supported \r\n\r\nA welcoming space to relax, connect, and celebrate together ',NULL,9,0,NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,0),(1051,'March Madness Event',19,'15:00:00','18:00:00','Legacy Reserve',0,0,1,0,'2025-03-29','agp@berea.edu','Angel Alexander',0,'Come celebrate March madness with us at Legacy Reserve, we will enjoy some small finger food and participate in basketball-related activities.',NULL,1,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(1052,'Community and Civic Engagement Minor- Interest Meeting',19,'12:00:00','13:00:00','Stephenson Hall, Second Floor, Arts and Crafts Room 208',0,1,0,0,'2025-03-31','heggensa@berea.edu','Sarah Heggen',1,'Do you have a passion for community service and engagement, and you\'re wondering how your chosen major could be intertwined with your interests? Come on down to CELTS for lunch on March 31st and the CCE minor advisors will be on hand to answer your questions!\r\n*Pizza provided, please RSVP here on CELTSlink.\r\n**If you are interested in the minor, you can visit your profile here on CELTSlink and check the box in the upper right hand corner!',20,9,0,NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,0),(1053,'Fun Friday 1',19,'15:00:00','17:00:00','Stephenson Hall, 2nd floor, room 212',0,0,1,0,'2025-02-21','bereatutoring@berea.edu','Eric Sparks',0,'Fun Friday - fun activities for tutees and tutors who wish to attend.',NULL,4,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(1054,'Sustainable Berea Volunteer Trip',19,'14:00:00','16:00:00','Sustainable Berea ',0,1,1,0,'2025-04-12','pwc@berea.edu','Rhea Clayton',0,'We will be helping Sustainable Berea clean up after their annual garden bed BLITZ event. Additionally, we will be helping weed gardens and do other general tasks. ',NULL,7,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(1055,'Card Making Event: April',19,'18:00:00','20:00:00','Stephenson Room 218',0,0,1,0,'2025-04-01','agp@berea.edu','Angel Alexander',0,'Join our team and help make birthday cards for our residents at Dominion! Snacks will be provided!',NULL,1,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(1056,'Deck Demolition and Reconstruction',19,'08:30:00','16:30:00','Richmond, KY',0,1,1,0,'2025-04-12','habitat@berea.edu','Summer Bahr',1,'We\'re traveling to Richmond to help demolish and reconstruct a front and back porch! We\'ll depart from the parking lot behind Woods-Penn at 8:30 AM and return no later than 4:30 PM. Let us know if you have any questions! ',10,5,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(1057,'Immigration Advocacy Event ',19,'18:00:00','20:00:00','Baird Lounge',0,0,0,0,'2025-04-10','hop@berea.edu','Rilie Ledford',1,'The SJ Cafe and HOP Talk collaboration will feature Neighbors Immigration Clinic, who will discuss their work and immigration laws. They will give a presentation and hold a Q&A session for the attendees. Then, a quilt-making activity will be introduced, allowing people to make a quilt square reflecting their perspective on immigration. ',NULL,6,0,NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,0),(1058,'Café SJ: A Survivor Is... Healing Through Expression',19,'18:30:00','20:00:00','Stephenson Hall, Room 208, Arts and Crafts Room',0,0,0,0,'2025-04-16','pwc@berea.edu','Rhea Clayton',1,'The People Who Care team would like to invite you all to our last Cafe Social Justice of the semester! We will be spreading awareness and resources for Sexual Violence Awareness Month.\r\n\r\nIn collaboration with the Sexual Violence Resource Center, we will have guests to share information and local resources on sexual violence. We will have an activity to foster creative expression, advocacy, and offer resources for survivors. ❤️\r\n\r\nAdditionally, painting supplies and other crafts to decorate your own journals!????✨\r\n\r\nWhen? Wednesday, April 16th @6:30pm\r\nWhere? Stephenson Hall, Arts & Crafts Room (208)\r\nJournals, paints, snacks, sweets, and tea will be provided!',NULL,7,0,NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,0),(1059,'Empty Bowls ',19,'17:00:00','19:30:00','Woods-Penn',0,0,1,0,'2025-04-02','heggensa@berea.edu','Sarah Heggen',0,'Annual fundraiser for the Berea Foodbank ',NULL,8,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(1060,'Fun Friday 3',19,'15:00:00','17:00:00','Stephenson Hall, 2nd floor, room 212',0,0,1,0,'2025-03-28','bereatutoring@berea.edu','Eric Sparks',0,'Fun Friday',NULL,4,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(1061,'All-CELTS training',21,'09:30:00','16:00:00','Activities Room, Stephenson Hall',1,0,0,0,'2025-08-19','heggensa@berea.edu','Sarah Heggen',1,'Happy first day of labor! All CELTS students meet together today for training, lunch, and program break-outs.',NULL,9,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,1),(1062,'Labor Meeting 8/26/2025',21,'16:00:00','17:00:00','activities room ',1,0,0,0,'2025-08-26','heggensa@berea.edu','Sarah Heggen',0,'Weekly Labor Meeting for CELTS students ',NULL,9,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,1),(1063,'Volunteer Training ',21,'17:00:00','18:00:00','Stephenson Hall, 2nd Floor, Room 208 - Arts and Crafts Room',1,0,0,0,'2025-09-11','agp@berea.edu','Chris Gonzalez',0,'Requirement to attend any of our volunteer events!',NULL,1,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,1,0),(1064,'Volunteer Training ',21,'17:00:00','18:00:00','Stephenson Hall, 2nd Floor, Room 208 - Arts and Crafts Room',1,0,0,0,'2025-09-18','agp@berea.edu','Chris Gonzalez',0,'Requirement to attend any of our volunteer events!',NULL,1,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,1,0),(1065,'Habitat-Specific Training ',21,'16:00:00','18:00:00','Stephenson Hall, Room 226',1,0,0,0,'2025-09-12','habitat@berea.edu','Jared Bueno ',0,'Please join us in Stephenson Hall, Room 226, as we go through the important details pertaining to Habitat volunteer work and what you can expect in the year ahead as a Habitat volunteer! There will be two sessions to choose from: one from 4:00–5:00 PM and another from 5:00–6:00 PM.',NULL,5,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(1066,'',21,'18:00:00','19:30:00','Activities Room 214, Stephenson Hall',1,0,0,1,'2025-08-27','heggensa@berea.edu','Sarah Heggen',0,'Training for all CELTS programs\' volunteers- after you attend ONE of these All Volunteer sessions, you can attend the program-specific trainings!',NULL,9,0,'heggensa','2025-08-27 13:18:09',0,0,NULL,0),(1067,'All Volunteer Training',21,'18:00:00','19:30:00','Activities Room 214, Stephenson Hall',1,0,0,1,'2025-08-27','heggensa@berea.edu','Sarah Heggen',0,'Training for all CELTS programs- required to volunteer! Once you attend ONE of the All Volunteer trainings- offered Aug. 27 and Sept. 4- you will then attend program-specific trainings for whichever program(s) you\'d like to volunteer with.',NULL,9,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(1068,'All Volunteer Training',21,'18:00:00','19:30:00','Stephenson Hall Room 214',1,0,0,1,'2025-09-04','heggensa@berea.edu','Sarah Heggen',0,'Training for all CELTS programs: All volunteers are required to attend 1 All Volunteer Training. Afterwards you may attend other program specific trainings.',NULL,9,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(1069,'All Bonners Meeting Fall 2025',21,'17:00:00','19:00:00','Activities Room',0,0,0,0,'2025-09-07','emekaibej@berea.edu','Joyce Emeka-Ibe',1,'All Bonners\' Meetings are required to be attended by all Bonners each semester.',NULL,10,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(1070,'People Who Care Training',21,'16:30:00','18:00:00','CELTS Connector ',1,0,0,0,'2025-09-04','pwc@berea.edu','Hannah Brown',0,'Required training for People Who Care volunteers! Please also attend at least one ALL CELTS training as well. If you were unable to attend an all CELTS training, contact PWC@Berea.edu. \r\n',NULL,7,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,2,0),(1071,'People Who Care Training',21,'13:00:00','15:00:00','CELTS Connector ',1,0,0,0,'2025-09-05','pwc@berea.edu','Hannah Brown',0,'Required training for People Who Care volunteers\r\n\r\nAll volunteer training is also required.',NULL,7,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,2,0),(1072,'Berea Buddies Training 1',21,'18:00:00','19:00:00','Activities Room',1,0,0,0,'2025-09-08','bereabuddies@berea.edu','Ashley Sanchez',0,'Berea Buddies volunteer training',NULL,2,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(1073,'Berea Buddies Training 2',21,'18:00:00','19:00:00','Activities Room',1,0,0,0,'2025-09-09','bereabuddies@berea.edu','Ashley Sanchez',0,'Berea Buddies Volunteer Training',NULL,2,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),(1074,'Chill with PWC: Fall Leaves',21,'17:00:00','19:00:00','Arts and Crafts Room',0,0,0,0,'2025-09-25','pwc@berea.edu','Hannah Brown',1,'Join People Who Care in celebrating the fall weather by making fun crafts using real fall leaves! We will be providing cozy snacks, a warm space, and educational resources!',NULL,7,0,NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,0),(1075,'CELTS labor meeting',21,'16:00:00','17:00:00','Activities room',1,0,0,0,'2025-09-02','heggensa@berea.edu','Sarah Heggen',0,'CELTS weekly labor meeting',NULL,9,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0);
